category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libgomp1 libmetis0 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Numerical linear algebra software package (runtime)"
ldesc: "Ginkgo is a high-performance linear algebra library for manycore systems, with
a focus on sparse solution of linear systems. It is implemented using modern
C++ (you will need at least C++14 compliant compiler to build it), with GPU
kernels implemented in CUDA and HIP."
external-source: ginkgo

